<title>POLAND: POLISH INSURER POLISA ZYCIE APPOINTS NEW CEO.</title>
<headline>POLISH INSURER POLISA ZYCIE APPOINTS NEW CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's medium-size life insurance firm Polisa Zycie SA has appointed Henryk Chmielak as its new president, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It was not clear from the statement whether the company's former president Bogdan Dabrowski resigned or was dismissed.</p>
<p>Chmielak was earlier a deputy finance minister and the president of insurance company Warta SA .</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
